{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_source_guides_generation_guide", "label": "Native Generation and Chat guide", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/source/guides/generation.rst", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Guide to OLMo-core's native autoregressive generation module: loading a model from a checkpoint, generating text programmatically, and using the built-in interactive chat CLI."}, {"id": "docs_source_guides_generation_load_from_checkpoint", "label": "Loading a generation module from a checkpoint", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/source/guides/generation.rst", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "TransformerGenerationModule.from_checkpoint loads a transformer and its weights from a checkpoint dir whose config.json holds the model architecture (model key) and tokenizer (dataset.tokenizer key). If config.json is missing, pass a TransformerConfig explicitly. dtype and attention_backend (DType, AttentionBackendName) are configurable."}, {"id": "docs_source_guides_generation_generate_batch", "label": "Batched generation with generate_batch", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/source/guides/generation.rst", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "generate_batch returns a tuple (generated_ids, logits, logprobs); logits/logprobs are None unless return_logits=True/return_logprobs=True. completions_only=True returns only newly generated tokens. Batched prompts of differing length require left-padding plus an attention_mask."}, {"id": "docs_source_guides_generation_generation_config", "label": "Generation configuration", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/source/guides/generation.rst", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "GenerationConfig controls token selection: max_new_tokens/max_length; do_sample (False = greedy); temperature (0.0 equivalent to greedy); top_k (-1 disables); top_p (nucleus sampling); use_cache (KV cache for faster autoregressive decoding, on by default); stop_token_ids (extra stop tokens beyond EOS). Any parameter can be overridden per generate_batch call. TransformerGenerationModuleConfig provides a structured config-based build() (e.g. compile_model=True)."}, {"id": "docs_source_guides_generation_weight_averaging", "label": "Checkpoint weight averaging", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/source/guides/generation.rst", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "TransformerGenerationModule.from_checkpoints averages the weights from multiple checkpoints before creating the generation module."}, {"id": "docs_source_guides_generation_chat_cli", "label": "Interactive chat CLI", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/source/guides/generation.rst", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "python -m olmo_core.generate.chat wraps the generation module in an interactive loop with conversation history and chat-template support (auto-detecting the tokenizer from config.json; a checkpoint URL works directly). On a Mac without Flash Attention use --attention-backend torch and --no-use-cache. A Jinja2 --chat-template formats messages for instruction-tuned models; --system-prompt prepends a system message; in-chat commands include /quit, /exit, /clear, /help."}, {"id": "src_olmo_core_generate_transformergenerationmodule", "label": "olmo_core.generate.TransformerGenerationModule", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/source/guides/generation.rst", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "src_olmo_core_generate_generationconfig", "label": "olmo_core.generate.GenerationConfig", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/source/guides/generation.rst", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "src_olmo_core_generate_transformergenerationmoduleconfig", "label": "olmo_core.generate.TransformerGenerationModuleConfig", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/source/guides/generation.rst", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "src_olmo_core_generate_chat", "label": "olmo_core.generate.chat", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/source/guides/generation.rst", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "src_olmo_core_config_dtype", "label": "olmo_core.config.DType", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/source/guides/generation.rst", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "src_olmo_core_nn_attention_attentionbackendname", "label": "olmo_core.nn.attention.AttentionBackendName", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/source/guides/generation.rst", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_source_guides_generation_guide", "target": "docs_source_guides_generation_load_from_checkpoint", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/source/guides/generation.rst", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_source_guides_generation_guide", "target": "docs_source_guides_generation_generate_batch", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/source/guides/generation.rst", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_source_guides_generation_guide", "target": "docs_source_guid